.14902 .203922 .258824 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 40.1 Tm /F1 8.7 Tf 12.2 TL (Suppose a customer sends POST /api/tickets. The route matches the URL and method. Authentication middleware) Tj T* (checks who is making the request. Validation middleware checks the supplied title and description. The controller) Tj T* (handles the HTTP request and calls a ticket service. The service applies business rules and stores the new ticket in) Tj T* (temporary data or the database. The controller sends the response.) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
