.14902 .203922 .258824 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 15.7 Tm /F1 8.7 Tf 12.2 TL (Not every route needs every layer. A small health endpoint may be handled by a simple route handler. We introduce) Tj T* (separation when it makes the code easier to understand, test and maintain.) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
